WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:10.280
Your new cellmate.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.400
The problem is that he turned over
a new leaf while in jail.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.080
He's heading over.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.760
That's precisely the plan.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.640
Let's take on the job.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.160
Damn it!

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.280
-Please, repeat--
-Good evening.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.760
Please stop already!
Let me down immediately!

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.600
God dammit, what is that?

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:21.920
Gosh.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.160
It looks like it worked too well.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.880
-What is it?
-I'm from IT.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.680
How will we prove she's real?

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:35.400
We can never prove it.
It depends entirely on them.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.840
I never joke around with makeup. There.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.280
I'm an FBI special agent.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:42.760
Pola Dickens.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:43.720
Good evening.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.000
I'm taking over now.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.440
No one told me.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.480
This is my mountain.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:52.960
We're not incompetent.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:56.600
Does that mean
you're deliberately not arresting him?

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.480
Detective Anderson?

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.520
-No!
-Yes.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.560
-No!
-You said, "See this to the end."

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.720
Eating after work is the best.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.640
Arsène Lupin, Gentleman Burglar.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.840
I'm Laurent.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:21.960
I'm riding the train with him.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.680
But he's with his wife and his kid.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.840
But get rid of him for good.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.080
-You stood him up three times.
-I'm not the perfect dad.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.000
The defendant is guilty.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.880
A jail sentence of 18 months.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.760
And a 3-year suspended sentence.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.080
But I'll always believe you.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.080
Let's save some time.
I bid 60 million euros.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.720
66 million.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.520
67 million.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.960
68 million.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:54.800
Sold!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.360
He should know who his grandpa was.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.600
Take them out.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.000
-Assane.
-I know what I'm doing.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:44.040
In reality, living like a peasant
doesn't suit you.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.800
It's not feasible for you.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.520
You're a swindler by nature.

